left to right direction

title Use Case Diagram for AI-Powered Analysis & Insights System

rectangle "System" {
  usecase "CFR001: View Financial Insights Dashboard" as CFR001
  usecase "SAFR001: Manage Analysis Parameters" as SAFR001
  usecase "CFR002: Receive Alerts for Anomalous Transactions" as CFR002
  usecase "CFR003: View Financial Predictions Based on Historical Data and Market Trends" as CFR003
  usecase "CFR004: Personalized Recommendations Aligned with Financial Goals" as CFR004
  usecase "CFR005: Manage Preferences for Personalized Recommendations" as CFR005
  usecase "CFR006: View Spending Limit Alerts Exceeding Predefined Thresholds" as CFR006
  usecase "CFR007: Access Investment Opportunities Based on Risk Profile" as CFR007
  usecase "CFR008: Receive News Related to Investment Portfolio" as CFR008
  usecase "CFR009: Consolidated Financial Information in a Single View" as CFR010
  usecase "SAFR002: Manage Client Mentoring Sessions Based on System-Generated Insights" as SAFR002
  usecase "FAFR001: Configure Analysis Parameters for Specific Client Segments" as FAFR004
  usecase "SFR001: Deliver Alerts Through Notification Channels" as SFR001
  usecase "AIFR001: Generate Financial Predictions Based on Historical Data and Market Trends" as AIFR001

  Client --> CFR001 : View financial insights dashboard  
  SysAdmin --> SAFR001 : Manage analysis parameters for AI system  
  User --> SFR002 : Manage client mentoring sessions (via FAFR003)  
  FinancialAdvisor --> FAFR004 : Configure analysis params per segment  
  Client --> CFR002 : Receive alerts on anomalous transactions  
  Client --> AIFR001 : Request financial predictions for insights  
  Client --> AIFR002 : Personalized recommendations based on profile and goals  
  Client --> SFR003 : Financial health reports (via SFR017)  
  Client --> CFR006 : Spending limit alerts when exceeding thresholds  
  Client --> AIFR004 : Investment opportunities aligned with risk profile  
  Client --> CFR008 : Access portfolio-related news  
  Client --> CFR009 : Consolidated financial info dashboard (via SFR012)  
  Client --> SAFR003 : Manage system requests for predictions (via AIFR001)  
  SysAdmin --> SAFA005 : Monitor and adjust system performance (related to AI accuracy?)  
}

